;---------------------------------------------------
;
; Coding informations
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C0,J393 - Central control module for comfort system
C1,+0001 - Tamper alarm (0 = 1 Tamper alarm / 10 = 10 Tamper alarms (PR-B09))
C2,+0002 - Logic anti-theft system (0 = RoW-logic/Thatcham / 2 = USA-logic or no anti-theft installed)
C3,+0004 - Selective Central Locking (PR-4K2/4K6/4K7)
C4,+0008 - Anti-theft warning system (PR-7AH/7AL)
C5,+0016 - Inclination sensor (PR-7AL)
C6,+0032 - Rear Lid Control Module -J605- (PR-4E7/4E9)
C7,+0064 - Comfort function via remote
C8,+0128 - Right hand steering (PR-L0R)
C9,+0512 - Rear shades (PR-3Y2/3Y5/3Y8)
C10,+1048 - Confirmation anti-theft warning system horn (PR-A8U)
C11,+2048 - RoW/USA - Rear Lights (0 = ECE lights / 2048 = SAE lights)
C12,+4096 - Foot well lights (PR-QQ1/QQ3)
;
